      "message": "Is that the only way to do that ? What does wifi CTS do ?\n\nThis will be tricky to get working reliably since you also need to make sure the lock screen is cleared, the screen is on, the device isn\u0027t stuck on some SIM pin screen or error dialog etc. Is there some shell command that could help for example ?\n\nCaptivePortalLogin tests make sure they start an activity to clear the keyguard before trying to use UiAutomation: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/CaptivePortalLogin/tests/src/com/android/captiveportallogin/RequestDismissKeyguardActivity.kt\n\nAlso OEM devices may have different UI so not relying on this would be best.",
